diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7765fed..d501a41 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -40,6 +40,14 @@ Cards automatically "postpone" (move to "not now") after inactivity:
 - Prevents endless todo lists from accumulating
 - Configurable via Account/Board settings
 
+### Email Digests
+
+Notification emails are batched per person instead of being sent one by one:
+- `User::Settings#bundle_email_frequency` is one of `never`, `every_few_hours`, `daily`, `weekly` (default `never`)
+- Each person's notifications are filed in a `Notification::EmailBundle` — a time window that opens when the first notification lands in it and closes after the chosen frequency
+- The window schedules its own delivery (`Notification::EmailBundle::DeliveryJob`), which sends one email for all the notifications in the window
+- A notification that lands while a window is open belongs to it; a new window only opens once the previous one closed, so windows never overlap
+
 ### UUID Primary Keys
 
 All tables use UUIDs (UUIDv7 format, base36-encoded as 25-char strings):
